@startuml

' ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
' Modelling conventions
' ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
' * Scope: user facing public API of mw::com; reference for the FMEA
'   (failure_modes.trlc).
' * Abstract model: only semantic operations. Special members, operators and
'   base classes (*Base, Interface<Trait>) are folded in; copy / move /
'   ownership is stated in the class note.
' * Lifecycle: Create() constructs, Release() destroys (only where destruction
'   has an effect). Service elements live and die with their owning Proxy /
'   Skeleton (composition).
' * Only the InstanceSpecifier variant of Create / FindService is modelled.
' * One class per variant with a distinct API (ProxyMethod per
'   specialization, field per tag; identical APIs merged).
' * Template parameters are in the quoted label; a parameter pack is one name
'   (ArgTypes).
' * The commented line above an operation is its strict UML signature
'   (in / out / inout, multiplicity, {query} = const); the tooling cannot
'   parse it yet.
' * Stereotypes: <<datatype>> value type described by its note, <<struct>>
'   plain aggregate, <<callback>> user callable, <<tag>> field tag,
'   <<free_functions>> namespace functions.
' ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

